  "_readme": [
    "This file holds one block per DOCUMENT, because the PDF holds more than one.",
    "Each block states the pages it covers, the types those pages name, and the",
    "value every key of that document's own form should come back with.",
    "\"\" means the document does not print this; null means not checked; a list",
    "means the page prints the value in more than one way and any of them counts.",
    "The file's headline score pools every block -- see app._merge_field_scores."
  ],
  "_note": [
    "Three documents: a tax invoice / delivery order across pages 1-2, the",
    "purchase order it was raised against on page 3, and an internal stock",
    "transfer request on page 4. No requirement covers any of the three types,",
    "so nothing in this file is Mandatory and every key is scored as found-only.",
    "Pages 1 and 2 are ONE document -- same number, same date, same PO and SO,",
    "and page 1's amounts sum exactly to page 2's Gross Total -- but they print",
    "the seller's tax ID differently (0105240027132 against 0105540047132).",
    "Both are accepted; page 3 prints 0105540047132, which is the likelier read.",
    "The left edge of pages 1 and 2 is cut off in the scan, so the letterhead",
    "and the party labels are transcribed as the fragments they are."
  ],
